    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">BFS shortest path</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid, 8 directions</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/shortest-path-in-binary-matrix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1091</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Shortest Path in Binary Matrix</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every move costs the same, so plain BFS from the top-left corner finds the shortest path: the level at which the bottom-right cell is first popped is the answer. Eight neighbours per cell, mark cells when you push them, check both corners first. O(n²) time and space.</p>\n"
